(  LINE EDITING COMMANDS                          WFR-79MAY03 ) : H                              ( HOLD NUMBERED LINE AT PAD *)       LINE  PAD  1+  C/L  DUP  PAD  C!  CMOVE  ;                                                                                : E                               ( ERASE LINE-1 WITH BLANKS *)       LINE  C/L  BLANKS  UPDATE  ;                                                                                              : S                             ( SPREAD MAKING LINE # BLANK *)       DUP  1  -  ( LIMIT )  0E ( FIRST TO MOVE )                      DO  I  LINE  I  1+  -MOVE  -1  +LOOP  E  ;                                                                                : D                         ( DELETE LINE-1, BUT HOLD IN PAD *)       DUP  H  0F  DUP  ROT                                            DO  I  1+  LINE  I  -MOVE  LOOP  E  ;                                                                                     -->                                                             